=== Complex Explanations ===
<pre>
{{Translation Notes
|notes=
* [1] Lines 1-3: Extended metaphor comparing life to a game of cards
* [2] Line 5: The word "春" (haru) creates a double meaning:
** As a noun: "spring"
** As a verb stem: "to stretch"
* [3] Lines 8-9: References the Japanese saying "猿も木から落ちる" (even monkeys fall from trees)
}}
</pre>
